  "description": "The Helium SLX is the lightest bike in the Helium road bike range. Our engineers went to great lengths to perfectly balance weight and stiffness. The more traditional yet sublime tube shapes make this the lightest road frame of all, weighing in at barely 750 grams for size medium. To ensure for comfort without sacrificing a single watt are the uniquely shaped ultra-thin chain stays. While the fork on this high-performance bike provides an incredibly stable feeling, even on the fastest, trickiest descents. The Helium SLX has received exceptionally high praise all around, to include victories at the modern race classic of Strade Bianche and to the top of Mont Ventoux. If you're keen on instantly riding faster, the Helium SLX is for you!",
